    text:"Barret Zoph announced on X that he is joining Google DeepMind to work on reinforcement learning and post-training, writing 'I started my AI career in the Google Brain Residency class and am excited to rejoin.' Zoph co-founded Thinking Machines Lab in February 2025, left OpenAI twice, and returns to Google as VP of research as DeepMind absorbs a string of departures including Jeff Dean and Noam Shazeer.",
