    text:"Seoul-based consumer AI platform Wrtn Technologies raised roughly $72 million in a Series C, valuing it above $722 million -- the first Korean AI service startup to cross that mark. New investors Coreline Ventures and Eugene Asset Management joined existing backers including Goodwater Capital and the Korea Development Bank; Wrtn says its AI entertainment app OOC topped 10 billion won in monthly revenue within three months of a May US launch.",
